受。麵條口感偏硬，能很好地吸附湯汁。叉燒肥瘦適中，口感軟嫩入味。但點餐後無法加麵，食量大的朋友要拿捏一下。\n\n除了經典拉麵，鐵板炒飯也頗具特色，上桌時香氣撲鼻，鍋底帶有些許鍋巴，增添了豐富的口感。整體而言，餐點也維持著品牌一貫的濃郁風味，想來一碗重擊味蕾的拉麵時，相當可靠的選擇。",null,[0,91]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3854483674654679929/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPVTA0eU1XRlVNMUY2WlVoQ2NsSXlkSFZpYXpsNlpFWkdWRmxYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3854483674654679929/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPVTA0eU1XRlVNMUY2WlVoQ2NsSXlkSFZpYXpsNlpFWkdWRmxYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3854483674654679929/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPVTA0eU1XRlVNMUY2WlVoQ2NsSXlkSFZpYXpsNlpFWkdWRmxYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3854483674654679929/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPVTA0eU1XRlVNMUY2WlVoQ2NsSXlkSFZpYXpsNlpFWkdWRmxYWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3854483674654679929/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPVTA0eU1XRlVNMUY2WlVoQ2NsSXlkSFZpYXpsNlpFWkdWRmxYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3854483674654679929/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPVTA0eU1XRlVNMUY2WlVoQ2NsSXlkSFZpYXpsNlpFWkdWRmxYWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,3821,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OU04yMWFUM1F6ZUhCclIydHViazl6ZEZGVFlXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x6155e601481cd7e5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnNSN21aT3QzeHBrR2tubk9zdFFTYWc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OU04yMWFUM1F6ZUhCclIydHViazl6ZEZGVFlXYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OU04yMWFUM1F6ZUhCclIydHViazl6ZEZGVFlXYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OU04yMWFUM1F6ZUhCclIydHViazl6ZEZGVFlXYxILMGNQbVZzakJVNGwaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uTlNOMjFhVDNRemVIQnJSMnR1Yms5emRGRlRZV2MSCzBjUG1Wc2pCVTRsIhIJAAA